        "original_id": "cfefe452-02a1-510d-be38-7499625802b7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mónica Troadello, Néstor Kirchner\n- Organizations: Front for Victory, Justicialist Party\n- Places: Mendoza Province, Argentina\n- Roles: Senator\n- Concepts: center-left, Peronism, electoral alliances, parliamentary groups\n\nFacts:\n- The Front for Victory is a center-left Peronist electoral alliance in Argentina.\n- The Front for Victory is formally a faction of the Justicialist Party.\n- Néstor Kirchner led the Front for Victory until his death in 2010.\n- Mónica Troadello is a former Senator for Mendoza Province.\n- Mónica Troadello was part of the majority Front for Victory parliamentary group.",
